### Day 14: Data fetching, pagination and optimistic update support
### Run Spring Boot first: mvn spring-boot:run

### Login as seeded admin
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@example.com",
  "password": "Admin@12345"
}


### Copy token from login response
@token = PASTE_ADMIN_TOKEN_HERE


### Paged assets - first page
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/assets/paged?page=0&size=5&sortBy=assetTag&direction=asc
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### Paged assets - second page
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/assets/paged?page=1&size=5&sortBy=assetTag&direction=asc
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### Paged assets - sorted by status
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/assets/paged?page=0&size=5&sortBy=status&direction=asc
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### Get all assets and copy one id for optimistic update test
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/assets
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### Update one asset status - same endpoint used by optimistic update
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/v1/assets/PASTE_REAL_ASSET_ID_HERE
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "assetTag": "PASTE_EXISTING_ASSET_TAG",
  "name": "PASTE_EXISTING_NAME",
  "category": "PASTE_EXISTING_CATEGORY",
  "serialNumber": "PASTE_EXISTING_SERIAL",
  "status": "MAINTENANCE",
  "location": "PASTE_EXISTING_LOCATION",
  "assignedTo": ""
}
